| Field | Required | Description |
| type | yes | Must be "prompt" |
| prompt | yes | The prompt text to send to the LLM. Use $ARGUMENTS as a placeholder for the hook input JSON. If $ARGUMENTS is not present, input JSON is appended to the prompt |
| model | no | Model to use for evaluation. Defaults to the model Claude Code uses for background functionality |
| timeout | no | Timeout in seconds. Default: 30 |
| continueOnBlock | no | On the events it applies to, true feeds an ok: false reason back to Claude and continues instead of ending the turn. Default: false . See Response schema for per-event behavior |

